<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Jan-Nov copper output up, alumina down.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Jan-Nov copper output up, alumina down.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's blister copper production rose to 27,148 tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996 from 20,924 in the same 1995 period, the State Institute of Statistics said.</p>
<p>It said alumina output fell to 146,325 tonnes in the same 1996 period from 164,011 tonnes a year ealier.</p>
</text>
